        "cooked": "<p>Okay, I am using iOS therfore I don‘t have a log. That‘s the reason why I am always taking a lot of pics.</p>\n<p>I know how to report bugs and did so several times in the past :) A&nbsp;bug report will be send within minutes.</p>\n<p>Thanks for the feedback, people at discord said it‘s working as intended but I was still sceptical.&nbsp;</p>",
